# OpenAI key: gpt-4o-mini answers the chat and the online judge uses the same
# provider (https://platform.openai.com/api-keys)
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Opik workspace and endpoint. The defaults below are a local self-hosted Opik
# (http://localhost:5173 in the browser). For Opik Cloud use
# https://www.comet.com/opik/api, your workspace name, and set OPIK_API_KEY.
OPIK_URL_OVERRIDE=http://localhost:5173/api/
OPIK_WORKSPACE=default
OPIK_API_KEY=

# Optional: port for the scripted demo's temporary server (default 4191)
# DEMO_PORT=4191

# Optional: set to true to switch off the telemetry spans (see lib/telemetry.ts)
# OPIK_TRACK_DISABLE=false
